title: Leo Jogiches
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
view-if: adv_show_jogiches = 1
new-page: true

= Leo Jogiches

The organiser. He ran the Spartacus League's illegal network through the war, and he has spent his life in the underground of three empires. He rarely speaks in public and keeps no notes.

[? if luxemburg_alive = 0 : Since Rosa's murder he hardly sleeps. ?]

- @network
- @investigate
- @root: Return to main

@network
title: Go Underground
subtitle: Safe houses and false papers where the police press hardest.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
var d = RG.target('repression');
RG.district(d, {repression: -15, guards: 0.5});
!}

Jogiches goes to [+ sys_target_name +] under another name. He finds printers who keep their mouths shut and landladies who ask no questions, and within a month the district committee can meet again.

@investigate
title: Hunt the Murderers
subtitle: Name the officers who killed our comrades. The government is shamed.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 5;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.worker_support += 4;
Q.spd_relation -= 6;
Q.repression += 3;
!}

Jogiches collects witnesses, hotel staff, and photographs of officers of the Guards Cavalry Rifle Division drinking to their work. Die Rote Fahne prints all of it.
